  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with o→ue stem change and z→c spelling change before e",
    "Stem change applies in presente (all forms except nosotros/nosotras): *almuerzo, almuerzas, almuerza, almuerzan*",
    "z→c spelling change applies in yo pretérito indefinido: *almorcé* (not *\\*almorzé*)",
    "Subjuntivo nosotros reverts to infinitive stem with z→c: *almorcemos* (not *\\*almorzemos* or *\\*almuerz-*)",
    "No stem change in pretérito indefinido (-AR verbs never change in preterite)",
    "Past participle: almorzado (regular)",
    "*Almorzamos a las dos* = We have lunch at two",
    "*¿Dónde quieres almorzar hoy?* = Where do you want to have lunch today?",
    "Related: el almuerzo (lunch), comer (to eat/have lunch), cenar (to have dinner), desayunar (to have breakfast)"
  ],
